<section class="copy-section has-tables" id="from-the-risk-assessment-to-the-hardened-setup" aria-labelledby="from-the-risk-assessment-to-the-hardened-setup-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="from-the-risk-assessment-to-the-hardened-setup-heading">From the risk assessment to the hardened setup</h2></div><div class="section-detail">
<h3>Personal Shield</h3>
<p>Toza will strengthen the agreed settings and access arrangements around your threat model. Where needed, we establish new core accounts and migrate essential identity, recovery and critical-service access. We supply, configure and test two compatible physical security keys, test material changes and verify the applicable work against the checklist.</p>
<p>Personal teaching covers the changed setup and practical security habits: signing in, recovering access, sharing information and granting permissions. The private dated record gives you a reference for the work. A technically blocked or declined action is not presented as completed.</p>
<p>A typical Personal Shield engagement requires 7&#x2013;14 hours of in-person work, excluding the initial Assessment. The price includes one primary working day and a second if needed. Fourteen days of limited adjustment support cover issues directly related to Toza&apos;s changes through WhatsApp, Signal and scheduled calls; this does not involve remote control of your devices.</p>
<h3>Inner Circle Shield</h3>
<p>The initial &#x20AA;3,600 Assessment covers the initial client&apos;s two devices and relevant accounts. Review and mapping for the remaining group are included in the separately purchased Inner Circle engagement. Each person receives the same standard of hardening, essential migration, teaching and verification as Personal Shield, with two compatible security keys each, eight in total.</p>
<p>One shared home or home-office network and router are included in addition to the eight personal devices. We review and harden accessible settings and authorized administration. Replacement hardware, additional connected devices and additional locations are quoted separately. Scope, schedule and the final group price are confirmed in writing before acceptance.</p>
