<section class="copy-section is-disclosure" id="service-details" aria-labelledby="service-details-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><details class="section-disclosure"><summary><h2 id="service-details-heading">Service boundaries</h2></summary><div class="section-detail">
<p>Toza works within your authorized digital environment and agreed scope, on relevant access identified together. The service does not promise to discover every account or find and remove every exposure. A concern or current access path does not establish wrongdoing or past use; changing access cannot recall an independent copy already held elsewhere.</p>
<p>Toza does not investigate another person, reconstruct events forensically, collect legal evidence, give legal advice or provide routine IT support. The dated record documents work; it is not a forensic report, evidence document, certification or security guarantee.</p>
<p>You remain present, control your credentials and approve material changes. Toza does not keep your credentials for ongoing use, remotely control or monitor your devices, or install security software on them. Your situation is handled confidentially. <a href="/en/faq.html#privacy">How your information is handled</a> &#xB7; <a href="/en/faq.html#boundaries">Detailed service boundaries</a></p>
</div></details></div></section>
